{"id":353,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"勉強も部活も100:100で挑む中高一貫教育","feature_description":"東京都市大学付属は、主体的な学びを通じた確かな学力と、豊かな社会性、他者を思いやる心を育てます。6年一貫の教育課程では国際社会の課題を探究し、他者との協働を通じて解決策を生み出す力も重視。部活動は中高合同で取り組み、「勉強も部活も100:100」を掲げ、学業と活動の両方に挑戦する学校生活を支えています。生徒一人ひとりの学習や進路目標の実現を支える教育課程を整えています。","clubs":[{"id":6405,"name":"中学硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6407,"name":"中学軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6409,"name":"中学サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6411,"name":"中学硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6413,"name":"中学卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6415,"name":"中学水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6417,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6418,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6419,"name":"陸上部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6423,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6424,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6425,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-17"},{"id":6426,"name":"少林寺拳法部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.tcu-jsh.ed.jp/school-life/cl